          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Now is the time to get more out of life. By broadening your horizons you create more possibilities, more freedom and have more fun. Whether you learn a new language for new friendships, the love of your life, personal development, culture immersion, career advancement, adventure travel or as an enjoyable hobby, you will benefit tremendously. Stop missing out. Your rewarding experience begins today.</p><p><br/>We provide everything you need to excel in real-world conversations.</p><p>Which language do you want to speak?</p>",
